  "comments": "<p>Released in the coronation year of King Charles III, the designs feature eight brand-new reverse designs that pay tribute to King Charles III, the four nations of the United Kingdom and the natural world.</p><p>The 2023 strike entered circulation on the 27th of November 2023 and does not feature the privy mark.&nbsp;<br><br>The 2023 strikes issued in the Brilliant Uncirculated and Proof Sets feature a special Tudor crown privy mark. Sets issued were a Brilliant Uncirculated Definitive Set (sales unknown), a BU historic set which included a set of 1948 coinage (issue limit: 2,023; sales 2,023) a first and last BU set (sales unknown) as well as in Proof (Issue limit: 12,023; sales unknown)<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c530062f5e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c530062f5e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c5617b0304.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c5617b0304.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c56216472a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c56216472a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c5657324d5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c5657324d5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/652c56dd24b18.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/652c56dd24b18.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© The Royal Mint, 2023<br>The coin was available at the Royal Mint Experience as a Brilliant Uncirculated ‘Strike Your Own’ edition between 16/10/23 - 05/11/23. (sales unknown)<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/653b1b308ca46.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/653b1b308ca46.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>&nbsp;</p><p>The 2024 strike was issued as part of the Annual Commemorative Proof (7,500 issue limit), Premium Commemorative Proof (2,024 issue limit) and Brilliant Uncirculated Commemorative sets.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659dfc486604a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659dfc486604a.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659dfc5744f42.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659dfc5744f42.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659dfc5da495e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659dfc5da495e.jpg\"></a></p><p>© The Royal Mint, 2024</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">The 2025 strike was issued as part of the Annual Commemorative Proof (7,500 issue limit), Premium Commemorative Proof (2,024 issue limit) and the Brilliant Uncirculated strike was in Commemorative sets.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6783d0ad3b2a2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6783d0ad3b2a2.jpg\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6783d0bc589aa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6783d0bc589aa.jpg\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6783d0c474cdf.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6783d0c474cdf.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">© The Royal Mint, 2025</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p>The 2026 coin was issued as part of the Annual Commemorative Proof set (6,500 issue limit), Premium Commemorative Proof set (2,000 issue limit) and the Brilliant Uncirculated strike was in the Definitive set, the Annual set and the Baby Set.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5cf6ba3a0.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5cf6ba3a0.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d04df9e1.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d04df9e1.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d14e6368.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d14e6368.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d2057014.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d2057014.webp\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695f5d2d252fc.webp\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695f5d2d252fc.webp\"></a></p><p>© The Royal Mint, 2026</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The design was also struck in silver proof and gold proof.</p>",
